  "Scenes.Holliscene.CallDatJojo.ApologiesSmellOnlyWay": "[pg][say: Apologies, [name], but the sound and smell were the only way I could be sure of knowing and finding you when you needed me!] He raises a cloth over his nose, then hefts his staff. [say: If you choose to fight this demon plant creature, I will try to start a blaze to limit her ability to regrow. It will take a lot of wood to burn a tree so unnatural, so I will not be able to do much else but ferry tinder from the stock I've been laying in. You will have to hold her attention.]"
