  "Scenes.Holliscene.CallDatJojo.TakeOutTalismanSummon": "You take out the small talisman you got from the mouse monk, wondering just how to summon him with it. A small string dangles from the side; when you pull it, you can feel a stitch coming undone and the weight of the talisman shifts toward the bottom. A thick, billowing yellow smoke begins to pour out. God, this reeks! You hurl it away before the smell can permeate your clothing, and it sets off an echoing bang when it hits the ground! It's not long before Jojo appears from the edge of the forest and calls to you."
