  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.PitcherRootsMuddyPuddle": "[pg]A set of pitcher-pot tipped roots emerge from the muddy puddle below, wiggling happily in your milk-streams as they climb higher. It does not take them long to find your [nipples] or latch on. Indeed, they begin to suck almost immediately, drawing deep, vacuuming breaths with a pleasant, staccato rhythm. You leaky teats let down, hard, and gush incredible amounts of milk with little effort, which the plant-slut happily sucks up. She remarks, [say: That's... mmm... good,] and begins to pant, clearly enjoying your confused, sloppy attempts at oral combined with the feelings coming from her tentacles as they double-team your tightly-packed pussy."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.ProceedsJackSparrowMinutes": " She proceeds to sing about Jack Sparrow's awesome adventures for a solid ten minutes, then goes on as if nothing had happened."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.PromisesLoveLieBack": "[pg][say: Oh, you're going to love this, [name],] the demon tree promises, [say: Just lie back into my tentacles, and let me do the work. You'll feel so good, you'll NEVER want to leave.]"
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.SmirkKnowinglySuggestWhat": "You smirk knowingly and suggest to Holli that she take you for a ride... if she knows what you mean. This earns you a pleased applause from the delighted demon dryad, and she immediately sets to helping you undress, her eager tentacles lowering from the tree and arching up like searching snakes. You let her remove your [armor] with the patience of a goddess, shivering slightly when the sticky gear is peeled away from your eager undercarriage."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.SpittleSoakedTorrentJuices": "[pg]The spittle-soaked clit puffs up in your mouth, and a torrent of juices washes out from the folds below as the plant-woman achieves orgasm. In your cunt, one of the plant-pricks spasms and un-twines from its twin, sliding out of your warm, creme-oozing twat to spray the last of its load across your gushing nether-lips. Another takes its place, but then, the first monstrous member spurts out its own thick love, also withdrawing to plaster you with a wave of jizz. Again, a fresh cock burrows into your soaked sex, and the cycle repeats itself like over and over - one cock cums, pulls out, and is replaced. Then, another replaces it. Your [vagina] is so effectively tag-teamed that you cum mid-womb-bukkake, splattering your lubricants in a fan-shaped spray below while your hips writhe uselessly."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.SteadyEruptingLactatingHard": "steady streams of milk erupting from your nipples. When did you start lactating this hard?"
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.VibrantPurplesPinksBrighter": "[pg]The vibrant purples, pinks, and reds of the flower grow brighter and more intense. When did Holli gain bioluminescence? You barely suppress a giggle, which comes out as a snort, and turn to face the bright red, pollen-soaked bulb. It doesn't take any encouragement for you to open wide and swallow it into your maw, but you do manage to miss the first few times, earning a good smearing of the stuff on your cheeks for your troubles. The pollen is delicious, and as you lick it off, you get to savor the sweeter nectar below. Your saliva runs from the shaft and down the inner lips in a curtain, unimpeded by your facile lips. Meanwhile, you're aware of "
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.WakeUtterlySoakedJizz": "[pg]You wake up, utterly soaked with girl-goo and jizz at the base of the tree. Holli is nowhere to be found, hidden behind her bark to rest in all likelihood. She did quite the number on you - "
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.WalkingBowleggedExclamation": "you'll be walking bowlegged for a week!"
  "Scenes.Holliscene.Level4RideHollisTentacruels.WalkingBowleggedWeekLegs": "you'd be walking bowlegged for a week, if you had legs."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.MakeUpSomething.BreatheReliefTruthGives": "[pg]You breathe a sigh of relief and assure her you're telling the truth. She gives you a weak, sorrowful smile and leaves. Your heart wrenches, and you wonder if a lie like that was worth it. You shake the thoughts from your head as best you can."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.MakeUpSomething.DrawBreathExplanationOff": "[pg]You draw breath to begin your explanation, and she attempts to cut you off. You stare at her in a pleading way, and she stops. Despite the vile nature of the tree, she believes you should get one chance at an explanation."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.MakeUpSomething.EyesNarrowLowersJudging": "[pg]Amily's eyes narrow and she lowers her head, judging your story. For a moment, you believe she's going to call you out on your lie, but she just sighs. [say: It's hard for me to believe, but despite your meetings with Marae and that disgusting tree, you're still not corrupted. I'm choosing to accept that excuse, [name]. I hope my trust isn't misplaced. But if you're lying, to my face, without the taint of corruption to warp your thoughts, just to keep this vile thing in here for you to fuck... then you're a worse person than some of these demons. I can't accept that. I won't.]"
  "Scenes.Holliscene.MakeUpSomething.LetFinishOutburstPanting": "You let Amily finish her outburst. Panting, she crosses her arms and eyeballs you, half expecting you to talk, and half expecting you to just stand there, dumbfounded."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.MakeUpSomething.UsingSmartsMakeStory": "[pg]Using your smarts, you make up a story on the spot. You tell her what happened at the factory, and explain that Marae, corrupted as she is, made you an offer you couldn't refuse. In exchange for not destroying you and your camp, you have to please that monstrosity of a tree constantly. You tell her that you're not strong enough to take on Marae herself, so you have to play her disturbing game for now."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.NoPlzDontFuckWithFarm.SighsFickleMortalGoddess": "[say: Such a fickle mortal,] she sighs. [say: But I am a kind goddess. Ask me for it anytime, assuming you've... performed the rites.]"
  "Scenes.Holliscene.RecruitJojoToCamp.BowingNeatlyTakesLeave": "[pg]Bowing neatly, he takes his leave."
  "Scenes.Holliscene.RecruitJojoToCamp.KeyGainedHollisAshes": "[pg](Key Item Gained: Holli's Ashes)"
  "Scenes.Holliscene.RecruitJojoToCamp.NodsEagerlyInviteCamp": "Jojo nods eagerly at you when you invite him to share your camp. [say: Excellent idea. If you'll excuse me, I wish to attempt to purify the spot where the creature grew, and then I will fetch my things.]"
